      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ref: 9336\nSuperb Four-Bedroom Town House in Central Location For Sale By Private Treaty\n\nLOCATION & DESCRIPTION: \nJack Quinn, Residential Expert with QUINN Property, is delighted to present this exceptional four-bedroom townhouse to the market. Ideally situated just five minutes from Gorey Main Street, this recently built home enjoys a superb location with an excellent choice of amenities and educational facilities close by. Gorey itself offers a wealth of restaurants, cafés, shops, pubs and hotels. For those who enjoy an active lifestyle, there is an impressive array of local leisure amenities on the doorstep, including endless sandy beaches, golf courses, swimming pools and leisure centres. With Wexford approximately a 40km drive from the property, Enniscorthy just a 35km drive and Dublin within a comfortable one-hour commute, the location is ideally positioned for both everyday convenience and easy access to larger towns and cities.\n\nCombining contemporary style, energy efficiency and an enviable location, this impressive home has been thoughtfully designed for modern living. Bright, spacious and beautifully appointed accommodation is complemented by high-quality finishes and excellent energy performance, creating a home that is both stylish and practical. Offering comfort, convenience and modern living in equal measure, this outstanding property represents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a stylish home in a well-connected and highly desirable location.\n\nAccommodation comprises as follows:\n\nEntrance Hall:3.25m x 2.80mTiled flooring, stairs to first floor.\nW.C.: 1.45m x 1.48mTiled flooring, W.C., W.H.B.\nKitchen/Dining Room:4.01m x 4.76mTiled flooring, fitted waist high and eye level units, double electric oven (combi oven microwave) and hob, tiled splashback, extractor fan, sliding doors to rear garden. \nUtility Room:2.82m x 1.84mTiled flooring, plumbed for washing machine, door to rear garden.\nStorage:1.09m x 1.84mConcrete flooring.\nLiving Room:5.32m x 3.80mCarpet flooring.\nLanding:3.19m x 3.25mCarpet flooring.\nBathroom:1.86m x 2.01mLinoleum flooring, W.C.B, W.H.B., bath with electric shower.\nBedroom 3:2.28m x 3.25mCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes.\nBedroom 2:3.56m x 3.44mCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes.\nBedroom 1:5.78m x 3.35mCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes.\nEn-Suite:1.61m x 2.21m Linoleum flooring, W.C., W.H.B., electric shower.\nBedroom 4:3.34m x 3.25mCarpet flooring, fitted wardrobes. \n\nOUTSIDE:\nTo the front, the property benefits from two private parking spaces and a neatly maintained lawn area, creating an attractive approach to the home. To the rear, the beautifully landscaped garden features manicured lawns, raised bedding areas and a sunken patio, providing an ideal space for outdoor dining, entertaining or simply relaxing. Enjoying pleasant country views, the rear garden offers a peaceful and private setting with excellent potential for making the most of outdoor living.\n\nSERVICES AND FEATURES:\nAll Mains Services\nAir To Water Heating\nSolar Panels\nWired for E.V. Charger\nProperty Extends To: C. 123 m2 \nBuilt: 2022\n\nBER DETAILS:\nBER: A2\nBER No. 115186256\nEnergy Performance Indicator: 37.55 kWh/m²/yr\n\n"
      },
